<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gekko gecko Turing wavenumber at 242 µm (Holocene, Pass 1) — MorphoEval overall 79.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 implements Schnakenberg kinetics whose fastest linear mode is calibrated to 242 µm on an 8×6-wavelength primordium (Holocene, 0 Ma). The dorsum crop of Dupont's CC BY-SA photograph is the pattern-class specimen. The sweep, ablation, and specimen segmentation exist in the script but are not yet the scored measurement sidecar; that closure is the Pass 2 remediation. Overall 79.9/100 (faithfulness 77.0, reproducibility 86.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 78, Parameter expressivity 70, Morphometric validation 68, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-gekko-gecko-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/gif, 3094317 B, 720×540 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 724f685b336c401afa62dbb64796d30e8f6cf6781c75a8d9cb10c51f8f18ac71 (sha256 724f685b336c401afa62dbb64796d30e8f6cf6781c75a8d9cb10c51f8f18ac71), spec_fingerprint 27a9ed0ed17fc21dd4fe57b407600983fabe4a2853287d2fa00a88e37c342dc7. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 27a9ed0ed17fc21dd4fe57b407600983fabe4a2853287d2fa00a88e37c342dc7; artifact_sha256: 724f685b336c401afa62dbb64796d30e8f6cf6781c75a8d9cb10c51f8f18ac71; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0/Gekko_gecko_dorsum_cc-by-sa.jpg=92d9092794d8c8df..., datasets/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0/Gekko_gecko_full_cc-by-sa.jpg=09aac21e60203080..., datasets/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0/gekko_gecko_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=b00877ae162067f0...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation for a two-species reaction-diffusion system. | Murray 1981 use of that wavelength as a coat pre-pattern. | Manukyan 2017 and Fofonjka 2021: reptile skin can carry a mesoscopic reaction-diffusion pattern (Timon, not Gekko). | Saenko 2013: gekkotan color colocalizes structural and pigment cells (Phelsuma, not Gekko).; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg field with (a, b) = (0.137, 0.863) and diffusion ratio 1.35 times critical, calibrated so k_c = argmax sigma(k) gives 242 µm. | Periodic 1936 µm × 1452 µm patch, seed 3235, 12-frame growth GIF.; transfer_boundary: 242 µm is the slot's primordium detail scale, not a published caliper measurement on Gekko gecko. | The Dupont photograph has no scale bar; it constrains pattern class only.; does_not_claim: That adult Tokay ocelli are 242 µm apart. | That Tokay chromatophores implement the Timon scale automaton. | That setal adhesion spacing is this pigment wavelength.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/model-fidelity, pressure P=0.9]: A second assessor from another provider has not scored this audit.",
        "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=1.5]: Specimen ocellus segmentation, coherency, and KS against the render; ablation amplitude.",
        "open need [parameter_sweep/parameter-expressivity, pressure P=1.3]: Score the diffusivity-scale sweep (Pearson r and RMSE) from executed output.",
        "remediation needed: R1: Put the six-point diffusivity sweep (Pearson r, RMSE) into the measurement sidecar.",
        "remediation needed: R2: Record the equal-diffusivity ablation and the reaction-off control against the patterned amplitude.",
        "remediation needed: R3: Segment the real dorsum crop (ocellus spacing, structure-tensor coherency) and compare to the render with values that are not copies of each other.",
        "remediation needed: R4: Report a two-sample KS statistic between specimen and simulation luminance.",
        "remediation needed: R5: Independent second assessor was not run.",
        "remediation needed: R6: Do not treat 242 µm as a length measured on the unscaled photograph." ;
    pk:hasScore 7.99e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

